  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate-Resilient Reconstruction after Flooding in Kerala (Loan)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Klimaresilienter Wiederaufbau nach Flutkatastrophe in Kerala (Projekt)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Durch selbst f&#xfc;r den Monsun ungew&#xf6;hnliche Starkregenereignisse kam es in 2018 und 2019 zu schweren &#xdc;berschwemmungen in Kerala. Neben dem Verlust von Menschenleben haben Hochwasser und zahlreiche Erdrutsche zu schweren Sch&#xe4;den an der Stra&#xdf;eninfrastruktur in dem dicht besiedelten Bundesstaat gef&#xfc;hrt. Ziel des Vorhabens ist es, die Stra&#xdf;eninfrastruktur klimaresilient wieder aufzubauen, um deren Resilienz gegen&#xfc;ber den aufgrund des Klimawandels h&#xe4;ufiger werdenden Starkregenereignissen zu st&#xe4;rken. Projekttr&#xe4;ger ist das Kerala State Transport Project.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Heavy rainfall events, unusual even for the monsoon, caused severe flooding in Kerala in 2018 and 2019. In addition to the loss of life, floods and numerous landslides caused severe damage to the road infrastructure in the densely populated state. The aim of the project is to rebuild the road infrastructure in a climate-resilient manner in order to strengthen its resilience to heavy rainfall events, which are becoming more frequent due to climate change. The project executing agency is the Kerala State Transport Project.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Heavy rainfall events, unusual even for the monsoon, caused severe flooding in Kerala in 2018 and 2019. In addition to the loss of life, floods and numerous landslides caused severe damage to the road infrastructure in the densely populated state. The aim of the project is to rebuild the road infrastructure in a climate-resilient manner in order to strengthen its resilience to heavy rainfall events, which are becoming more frequent due to climate change. The project executing agency is the Kerala State Transport Project.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Wiederaufgebaute Stra&#xdf;eninfrastruktur wird genutzt und deren Anf&#xe4;lligkeit f&#xfc;r k&#xfc;nftige Klimasch&#xe4;den ist reduziert</narrative>
  </description>
